{"id":"4b3b6c5abbff3cd9","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pblocalmax.md","title":"Derivative characterization of local maxima","display":"thm-pblocalmax — Derivative characterization of local maxima","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pblocalmax","aliases":["27-thm-pblocalmax"],"display":"thm-pblocalmax — Derivative characterization of local maxima","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbderivative]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.4.1","source_statement":"Theorem 13.11, Equation (13.39)","source_printed_pages":"586","source_pdf_pages":"610","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pblocalmax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pblocalmax</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pblocalmax — Derivative characterization of local maxima"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3020cb523ec5a332\" href=\"?note=3020cb523ec5a332\" title=\"27-df-pbderivative\">27-df-pbderivative</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.4.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Theorem 13.11, Equation (13.39)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"586"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"610"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\">\\(J_i\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^{i\\leftarrow b}\">\\(x^{i\\leftarrow b}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3020cb523ec5a332\" href=\"?note=3020cb523ec5a332\" title=\"27-df-pbderivative\">27-df-pbderivative</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(f(x)\\geq f(x^{i\\leftarrow1-x_i}))\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\left(((J_if)(x)&gt;0\\Rightarrow x_i=1)\\land((J_if)(x)&lt;0\\Rightarrow x_i=0)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(f(x)\\geq f(x^{i\\leftarrow1-x_i}))\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\left(((J_if)(x)&gt;0\\Rightarrow x_i=1)\\land((J_if)(x)&lt;0\\Rightarrow x_i=0)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 13.11、(13.39)，陈述和证明已核对。第 i 坐标为 1 时，f(x)−f(x^{i←0})=J_if(x)；为 0 时，邻点差为其相反数。导数为零时两种取值都允许。局部最优不意味着全局最优。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbderivative","status":"resolved","id":"3020cb523ec5a332","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbderivative]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbderivative","status":"resolved","id":"3020cb523ec5a332","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$x\\in\\mathbb B^n$；$J_i$ 和 $x^{i\\leftarrow b}$（see [[27-df-pbderivative]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"J_i","display":false},{"tex":"x^{i\\leftarrow b}","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(f(x)\\geq f(x^{i\\leftarrow1-x_i}))\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\left(((J_if)(x)>0\\Rightarrow x_i=1)\\land((J_if)(x)<0\\Rightarrow x_i=0)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1426,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-491","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pblocalmax|thm-pblocalmax — Derivative characterization of local maxima]]"}],"outgoing":["3020cb523ec5a332"]}